                                                            <li>Warte 5 Minuten und refresh</li>
                                                        </ul>
                                                    </div>

                                                    <div class="trouble-item">
                                                        <h5><i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle text-danger"></i> Problem: Alle Requests werden blockiert</h5>
