                                                        <ul>
                                                            <li>Bot-Score zu hoch? → <code>"MinimumBotScore": 10</code></li>
                                                            <li>Geo-Blocking zu restriktiv? → <code>"BlockedCountries": []</code></li>
                                                            <li>Threat-Score zu niedrig? → <code>"ThreatScoreThreshold": 10</code></li>
                                                        </ul>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
